{"title":"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 6","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>The sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/a/d/cad681354a2a529a1828a56b2b5629faec3cd128.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{a_n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"35\" height=\"18\" /> is defined by\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/0/8/408d131150595befc5ae2662573b99ec545e5819.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[a_0 = 1,a_1 = 1, \\text{ and } a_n = a_{n - 1} + \\frac {a_{n - 1}^2}{a_{n - 2}}\\text{ for }n\\ge2.\\]\" width=\"373\" height=\"42\" />\nThe sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/6/646c0524996280f8ceebcf176c24cfed07dc3935.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\{b_n\\}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"34\" height=\"18\" /> is defined by\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/3/a/e3a90aa84fa76712b0de3ce0ce81cdef9c1d3e8d.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[b_0 = 1,b_1 = 3, \\text{ and } b_n = b_{n - 1} + \\frac {b_{n - 1}^2}{b_{n - 2}}\\text{ for }n\\ge2.\\]\" width=\"364\" height=\"42\" />\nFind <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/4/5/945510aca28ad17663a903d049bf642bb3121e28.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {b_{32}}{a_{32}}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"26\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Rearranging the definitions, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/e/a/c/eac923f11fcde9dfa8ebb1b40688b782b7f3c02b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} = \\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}} + 1,\\quad \\frac{b_n}{b_{n-1}} = \\frac{b_{n-1}}{b_{n-2}} + 1\\]\" width=\"287\" height=\"40\" />\nfrom which it follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/c/0/1c08b0e5407f8afb9881f0bace3394b21de179dc.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{a_n}{a_{n-1}} = 1+ \\frac{a_{n-1}}{a_{n-2}} = \\cdots = (n-1) + \\frac{a_{1}}{a_0} = n$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"339\" height=\"35\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/0/6/60682cf5c8d74ccaa64b0c96571cdece657bc1f1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b_n}{b_{n-1}} = (n-1) + \\frac{b_{1}}{b_0} = n+2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"226\" height=\"40\" />. These <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Recursion\" title=\"Recursion\">recursions</a>, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/1/5/4152b5403870aab64395d41b45768295387a7902.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_{n} = na_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"87\" height=\"10\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/a/dda803f8d0501985161d60a0d4d75023a89ff9d9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_{n} = (n+2)b_{n-1}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"129\" height=\"18\" />, respectively, correspond to the explicit functions <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/9/2/392c1772a228af316f9338ccf4d0ce1362604761.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a_n = n!$\" style=\"vertical-align: -2px\" width=\"57\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/f/74fe08b9b4d20787e612ce2fe65194bfff8ece16.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b_n = \\frac{(n+2)!}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"104\" height=\"38\" /> (after applying our initial conditions). It follows that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/d/9/fd9a3b4f9e93f93dd0fe18c2c987cff930ad5ecd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{b_{32}}{a_{32}} = \\frac{\\frac{34!}{2}}{32!} = \\frac{34 \\cdot 33}{2} = \\boxed{561}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"220\" height=\"43\" />.\n</p><p>From this, we can determine that the sequence <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/8/598f8d87581049fd34134b4f560dfce2d3f2e1d6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac {b_n}{a_n}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -15px\" width=\"21\" height=\"40\" /> corresponds to the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Triangular_number\" title=\"Triangular number\">triangular numbers</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_6&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II\" title=\"2008 AIME II\">2008 AIME II</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Answer_Key\" title=\"2008 AIME II Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=2008\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">Problem 5</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">Problem 7</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2008_AIME_II_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"2008 AIME II Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261017214503\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: []\nCPU time usage: 0.030 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.052 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 147/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1806/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 128/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 2978/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.115      1 -total\n 58.05%    7.613      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.63%    5.197      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:6669:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261017214503 and revision id 55455. Rendering was triggered because: api-parse\n -->\n</div>"}